    <p class="eyebrow">Why conversational applications</p>
    <h1>Your next application won't be screens.</h1>
    <p class="page-hero__lede">For many customer-facing business workflows, it will be a guided conversation backed by a reliable application runtime — one that collects what it needs, applies your business rules, calls your real systems, and completes the task. PicoFlow is that runtime.</p>
